before:
Complete local C# example; the app does not execute it:
```csharp
using System;
using System.Threading.Tasks;
int minutes = await ReadMinutesAsync();
Console.WriteLine(minutes + 1);
static async Task<int> ReadMinutesAsync()
{
    await Task.Delay(10);
    return 4;
}
```

